  <item>
    <title>ep.38 荒野上，两个灵魂漫游 ｜ 《呼啸山庄》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae7658dc96c8942ec15ae62</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae7658dc96c8942ec15ae62</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听众朋友好，欢迎收听“昨日之海”，又一次姗姗来迟。筹备这一期其实很有压力，今年因为那部争议电影收获了很多关注度，并且应该也有不少节目讲过这本书了，我们尽力而为。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> 希斯克利夫的来处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 情感的预示，分离的开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 离开，以及凯瑟琳的自白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 复仇计划</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">44:53</a> 镜像陷阱：呼啸山庄二代三人组</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3377">56:17</a> 复仇文学蓝本</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3760">1:02:40</a> 凯瑟琳与希斯克利夫之间的爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4820">1:20:20</a> 奈莉：故事的讲述者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5280">1:28:00</a> 书籍与阅读的姿态：实现沟通的桥梁，抑或是回避的杀器</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6315">1:45:15</a> 节目最后闲聊小说细节</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
