    <guid isPermaLink="false">69faeef1e62b3c835c1f13d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 07:51:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好，欢迎收听昨日之海~</span></p><p><span>本期我们分享的是波兰作家奥尔加·托卡尔丘克的《云游》，这是一本很“神奇”的书，带给我们很多快乐和启迪，强烈推荐大家自己去阅读，去体验！</span></p><p><span>也欢迎各位在小宇宙、爱发电支持我们哇！</span></p><p><span>点击跳转：</span><a href="https://afdian.com/a/zuorizhihai" data-url="https://afdian.com/a/zuorizhihai"><span>昨日之海的爱发电</span></a></p><p><span>本期时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 随波逐流的阅读体感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 《阿基琉斯之腱》：“必须研究自己的疼痛。”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">37:47</a> 《旅行心理学》：“世界就在我们脑中”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>《肖邦的心脏》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>《我在这里》：旅行-心理学-防御机制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3381">56:21</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>《库尼茨基：X》：Kairos/时机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4721">78:41</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>《圣灰星期三的盛宴》：偏航的勇气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5171">86:11</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>与47生活的互文：巴黎十二区的旅行手册</span></p><p><span>下期预告：金蕨《脐带纪事》</span></p><p><span>本期提到的📚：</span></p><p><span>麦尔维尔《白鲸》</span></p><p><span>佩雷克《空间物种》</span></p><p><span>附：奥赛博物馆的《nymphéas bleu》/蓝色睡莲</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnxHw0-uaN4sRjuBdtD4BDoSfFjz.jpg"></figure><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
